{"id":"meute","lemma":"meute","pos":"noun","rank":4555,"glosses":["pack (of hounds)","mob (of people)"],"ipa":"/møt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-meute.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-meute.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"meutes"},"formAudio":{"meutes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-meutes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les loups vivent en meute.","en":"Wolves live in packs.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"wolf","l":"loup"},{"g":"to live","l":"vivre"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"La meute est aux trousses du renard.","en":"The hounds are in pursuit of the fox.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"fox"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"hot on someone's heels"]]},{"text":"Une meute de loups a attaqué le voyageur.","en":"A pack of wolves attacked the traveler.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"wolf","l":"loup"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to attack","l":"attaquer"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"nomadic, wandering"}]},{"text":"Une meute de chiens a suivi la trace du renard jusqu'à sa tanière.","en":"A pack of dogs tracked the fox to its lair.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"dog","l":"chien"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"following"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"trace"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"fox"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"lair, den"}]}]}